  "notes": "No amounts are shown on screen: all amounts are my estimates (~); the speech names rice flour, corn flour, salt and water for the batter and says to use very little oil. The video starts with the finished dish and the cook tasting it; I left those out. Boil time, heat and fry times are not shown. The flours are shown as two white piles (which is which is my guess). The sauce looks orange from the red chilli powder (the on-screen title calls the dish healthy Cajun potatoes). Protein figure depends on how much paneer you use."
